[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2600.069, "timestamp": "00:43:20", "text": "是的，我的浏览器有点卡顿。 这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2602.63, "timestamp": "00:43:22", "text": "滞后的。 这有点滞后。   呀呀呀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2608.87, "timestamp": "00:43:28", "text": "至少踢球动作还算正常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2612.069, "timestamp": "00:43:32", "text": "踢击有效。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2616.79, "timestamp": "00:43:36", "text": "如果大家都在看广告，那我有其他选择总是好事，对吧？ 如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2618.79, "timestamp": "00:43:38", "text": "你在 YouTube 和 Twitch 上看到广告，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2620.87, "timestamp": "00:43:40", "text": "你可以直接在 Kick 或 Beam 上观看我的直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2625.03, "timestamp": "00:43:45", "text": "这些网站完全没有广告。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2629.845, "timestamp": "00:43:49", "text": "所以你们就像是人们的选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2631.75, "timestamp": "00:43:51", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2634.95, "timestamp": "00:43:54", "text": "就是这样"}]